{
  "description": "Geography lab organism — an age-sex population pyramid simulator (learner drives birth/death/migration rate dials and steps a cohort-component projection across five age bands) and a simplified Köppen climate classifier (learner sets a summer/winter temperature and precipitation profile and a 12-month climograph classifies it), composed from the std-geo-population and std-geo-koppen instrument atoms behind a mode router.",
